The current Vagrant installation we have requires a large download and a number of manual steps. In order to make things easier for new developers, we would like a Vagrant setup that requires only the following steps:

1. Install VirtualBox 5.x and Vagrant 1.8.1
2. Clone the otwarchive repository
3. At a command prompt, go to the otwarchive folder and run {{vagrant up}}
4. Run the Rails server using {{vagrant ssh -c "cd /vagrant && bundle exec rails server"}}

