24/Sep/23 2:18 AM;557058:443ab871-4096-403e-bd6f-f3534fe417f0;{quote}Saving with a closed ticket ID boots me to users/USERNAME/pseuds/PSEUD in the URL but the page itself is still the edit page (this is a bit weird, but it is how it is for profiles too) and gives me the “ticket must be open" error message.{quote}

