28/Sep/16 6:08 PM;557058:443ab871-4096-403e-bd6f-f3534fe417f0;If we want to go with 2), the actual proper solution is to use get_title_string correctly, which will return "No rating" rather than "Not Rated":

{code:java}
<% ratings = prompt.any_rating ? "Any" : get_title_string(tag_groups["Rating"], "rating") %>
{code}

The reason it's not doing that is we're currently leaving out the category_name required in:

{code:java}
  def get_title_string(tags, category_name = "")
    if tags && tags.size > 0
      tags.collect(&:name).join(", ")
    elsif tags.blank? && category_name.blank?
     "Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings"
    else
      category_name.blank? ? "" : "No" + " " + category_name
    end
  end
{code}

